    {
      "id": "0r43xVkL51z0ffqidYyh4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1009.9891954171806,
      "y": 541.5919081332684,
      "width": 1252.2441537572158,
      "height": 1325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b03",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1037756158,
      "version": 2289,
      "versionNonce": 1336522348,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792146402863,
      "created": 1791793668593,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deep dive\n\n1. How to ensure low latency for searching?\n- ES + CDC\n\n2. How to keep consistency of booking tickets? \n- update ... where ... (CAS)\n\n3. How to update ticket status?\n- ticket status (available | reserved | booked) + Cron -> stale (cron's period)\n- ticket status (available | reserved | booked) + reservedTimestamp -> good\n- ticket status (available | booked) + Redis lock -> lost reserved when redis down\n\n4. How to deal with surge traffic? (APIGateway - Nignx horizontal scale)\n- database CAS: 0 ~ 10k\n- redis lock + database CAS: 10k ~ 100k (single redis instance); > 100k (redis cluster) -> lost reserved when redis down\n- redis sorted set (ranking) + database CAS: > 100k (ZADD, ZRANK, SSE, queue + admited)\n\n5. How to support booking multiple tickets?\n\n- book ticket\nPOST /tickets/reserve/ -> 200 OK\nHeader: JWT token | session (userId)\nBody: {\n    ticketIds[]\n}\n\nPOST /tickets/confirm -> 200 OK\nHeader: JWT token | session (userId)\nBody: {\n    ticketIds[],\n    paymentIntent,\n}\n\nBooking \n- id\n- ticketIds[]\n- status: pending | confirmed\n- ...\n\nTicket\n- ...\n- bookingId\n- ...\n\n- reserve\nBEGIN;\nINSERT booking ...\nUPDATE ticket ... WHERE ... (ORDER BY ticketId to avoid dead locking)\nCOMMIT;\n\n- book\n...",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deep dive\n\n1. How to ensure low latency for searching?\n- ES + CDC\n\n2. How to keep consistency of booking tickets? \n- update ... where ... (CAS)\n\n3. How to update ticket status?\n- ticket status (available | reserved | booked) + Cron -> stale (cron's period)\n- ticket status (available | reserved | booked) + reservedTimestamp -> good\n- ticket status (available | booked) + Redis lock -> lost reserved when redis down\n\n4. How to deal with surge traffic? (APIGateway - Nignx horizontal scale)\n- database CAS: 0 ~ 10k\n- redis lock + database CAS: 10k ~ 100k (single redis instance); > 100k (redis cluster) -> lost reserved when redis down\n- redis sorted set (ranking) + database CAS: > 100k (ZADD, ZRANK, SSE, queue + admited)\n\n5. How to support booking multiple tickets?\n\n- book ticket\nPOST /tickets/reserve/ -> 200 OK\nHeader: JWT token | session (userId)\nBody: {\n    ticketIds[]\n}\n\nPOST /tickets/confirm -> 200 OK\nHeader: JWT token | session (userId)\nBody: {\n    ticketIds[],\n    paymentIntent,\n}\n\nBooking \n- id\n- ticketIds[]\n- status: pending | confirmed\n- ...\n\nTicket\n- ...\n- bookingId\n- ...\n\n- reserve\nBEGIN;\nINSERT booking ...\nUPDATE ticket ... WHERE ... (ORDER BY ticketId to avoid dead locking)\nCOMMIT;\n\n- book\n...",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "biGtQ6TB2u9Ohw5ozZeDs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1975.606950380648,
      "y": 76.21441633018713,
      "width": 490.07965087890625,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b04",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 825819554,
      "version": 245,
      "versionNonce": 566507092,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792146402863,
      "created": 1791794306246,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SET ticket:{ticketId} userId NX EX 600\n\nMGET ticket:{ticketId1} ticket:{} ...\n+\nSELECT ...\nFROM tickets\nWHERE status = available\n\nEXPIRE ticket:{ticketId} 300\n\nlua release\n-- KEYS[1] = ticket:{ticketId}，ARGV[1] = userId\nif redis.call('GET', KEYS[1]) == ARGV[1] then\n  return redis.call('DEL', KEYS[1])\nend\nreturn 0",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SET ticket:{ticketId} userId NX EX 600\n\nMGET ticket:{ticketId1} ticket:{} ...\n+\nSELECT ...\nFROM tickets\nWHERE status = available\n\nEXPIRE ticket:{ticketId} 300\n\nlua release\n-- KEYS[1] = ticket:{ticketId}，ARGV[1] = userId\nif redis.call('GET', KEYS[1]) == ARGV[1] then\n  return redis.call('DEL', KEYS[1])\nend\nreturn 0",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "CoICVAAGCcCdSDiOF19dh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 281.704345703125,
      "y": 133.63990783691406,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 800,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b05",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 437406676,
      "version": 1288,
      "versionNonce": 1077260884,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792223256012,
      "created": 1792146406681,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Shorten URL\n\nFunctional requirements\n- write: create a short url using a long url (alias, expireTimestamp)\n- read: access the long url using a short url\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- CAP: availability >> consistency (eventually consistency, < 1m)\n- latency: low latency for both writing & reading ( < 200ms, read >> write)\n- scale: large volume of data / high traffic\n  10M DAU\n    traffic:\n      write: 10 * 10^7 / 10^5 = 10^3 /s\n      read: 100 * 10^7 / 10^5 = 10^4 /s\n    storage: 10^8 * 100B * 365 * 10 = 3.65 * 10 ^13 B = 36.5 T\n\nCore entities\n- User\n- URL\n\nAPI\n- create\n    POST /urls\n    Header: JWT | session (userId)\n    Body {\n        originalURL,\n        alias,\n        expireTimestamp\n    }\n\n- access\n    GET /:shortURL -> 302 originalURL",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Shorten URL\n\nFunctional requirements\n- write: create a short url using a long url (alias, expireTimestamp)\n- read: access the long url using a short url\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- CAP: availability >> consistency (eventually consistency, < 1m)\n- latency: low latency for both writing & reading ( < 200ms, read >> write)\n- scale: large volume of data / high traffic\n  10M DAU\n    traffic:\n      write: 10 * 10^7 / 10^5 = 10^3 /s\n      read: 100 * 10^7 / 10^5 = 10^4 /s\n    storage: 10^8 * 100B * 365 * 10 = 3.65 * 10 ^13 B = 36.5 T\n\nCore entities\n- User\n- URL\n\nAPI\n- create\n    POST /urls\n    Header: JWT | session (userId)\n    Body {\n        originalURL,\n        alias,\n        expireTimestamp\n    }\n\n- access\n    GET /:shortURL -> 302 originalURL",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
